```{.r .cell-code}
liz_mod <- glm(pushup ~ distance,
               data = lizard,
               family = "binomial")

summary(liz_mod)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```

Call:
glm(formula = pushup ~ distance, family = "binomial", data = lizard)

Coefficients:
            Estimate Std. Error z value Pr(>|z|)   
